; OpTypeVectorIdEXT: Component Count must be a constant instruction with scalar
; 32-bit integer type. Here the count is a 64-bit OpConstant, which the reverse
; translator must reject.

; RUN: not llvm-spirv -spirv-text -r %s -o %t.bc 2>&1 | FileCheck %s

; CHECK: InvalidInstruction
; CHECK: TypeVectorIdEXT: component count must have scalar 32-bit integer type

119734787 66304 458752 10 0
2 Capability Addresses
2 Capability Linkage
2 Capability Kernel
2 Capability Int64
2 Capability LongVectorEXT
6 Extension "SPV_EXT_long_vector"
3 MemoryModel 2 2
3 Source 3 102000
4 Name 1 "test"

6 Decorate 1 LinkageAttributes "test" Export
4 TypeInt 3 64 0
5 Constant 3 4 5 0
2 TypeVoid 2
3 TypeFloat 5 32
4 TypeVectorIdEXT 6 5 4
4 TypeFunction 7 2 6

5 Function 2 1 0 7
3 FunctionParameter 6 8

2 Label 9
1 Return

1 FunctionEnd
